OL,3,GNEWSAHusband admits killing wife found
OL,4,Adead in freezer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has pleaded guilty to murdering
OL,7,Fhis wife whose body was found in a
OL,8,Ffreezer at their home in West
OL,9,FYorkshire.
OL,11,FDavid Barraclough, 45, was due to go on
OL,12,Ftrial at Leeds Crown Court charged with
OL,13,Fkilling 37-year-old Carolann
OL,14,FBarraclough earlier this year.
OL,16,FHowever, on the day his trial was due
OL,17,Fto start, Barraclough, of Ken Churchill
OL,18,FDrive, in Horbury, near Wakefield,
OL,19,Fpleaded guilty to murder.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
